Package: eazy
Version: 3.3.7
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: eazy contributors <vapesmadcat-blip@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, python3, fzf, whiptail, gawk, findutils, sed, wget | curl, mpv | mplayer | vlc | ffmpeg
Recommends: xdg-utils, ffmpeg
Suggests: yt-dlp, aria2, axel, chafa, imagemagick, poppler-utils, p7zip-full, rar, konsole, dolphin, kate, kio-extras, gnome-terminal, nautilus, gedit, evince, pipewire-pulse, alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils, inxi, lm-sensors, smartmontools
Description: terminal media browser and player (GNOME/KDE)
 eazy is a keyboard-driven terminal media browser and player built around
 fzf and mpv/mplayer. Works on GNOME, KDE Plasma and other desktops.
 .
 Installs binary, notes editor, IA client, desktop launcher and full man page.
 User data in ~/.config/eazy is kept on removal.
